flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Begin optimization"]
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Attributes n_var n_obj n_constr xl xu n_replications base_seed<br/>Methods _evaluate"]
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**<br/>Six buffer capacities one per buffer<br/>{1-10} discrete integer"]
Algorithm["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Evolutionary loop managing populations<br/>Parameters pop_size n_gen"]
Sampling["**Sampling and Operators**<br/>Integer random sampling SBX crossover PM mutation<br/>Duplicate elimination enabled"]
Evaluate["**Evaluate Population**<br/>BufferCapacityProblem _evaluate called for batch of individuals"]
RunSimulation["**run_simulation**<br/>Inputs capacities seed warmup measure_until<br/>Performs multiple replications"]
SimModel["**Simulation Model**<br/>Machines DelayBuffer Stores part generator<br/>Returns per run throughput wip and energy metrics"]
ComputeObjectives["**Compute Objectives**<br/>Aggregate replications compute mean wip mean throughput<br/>Set F as wip and negative throughput"]
ConstraintCheck["**Constraint Check**<br/>Sum capacities less or equal 40 flagged infeasible<br/>Assign large bad objectives when infeasible"]
UpdatePop["**Population Update**<br/>Assign fitness apply selection crossover mutation replacement<br/>Record feasible individuals to history"]
Termination["**Termination Check**<br/>Stop when generation limit reached or termination criteria met"]
History["**History Store**<br/>Save feasible solutions per generation with KPIs and capacities"]
ExportCSV["**export_history_to_csv**<br/>Read history write CSV with generation individual capacities wip throughput"]
End["**End**<br/>Optimization complete and results exported"]

Start --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> DecisionVars
DecisionVars --> Algorithm
Algorithm --> Sampling
Sampling --> Evaluate
Evaluate --> RunSimulation
RunSimulation --> SimModel
SimModel --> ComputeObjectives
ComputeObjectives --> ConstraintCheck
ConstraintCheck --> UpdatePop
UpdatePop --> History
UpdatePop --> Termination
Termination -->|not finished| Evaluate
Termination -->|finished| ExportCSV
ExportCSV --> End